<title>USA: AMEX names senior vice president of derivatives.</title>
<headline>AMEX names senior vice president of derivatives.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said on Monday it named Michael Bickford senior vice president of derivative securities marketing and research.</p>
<p>Bickford will supervise the listing, marketing and research support for all equity derivatives, equity options and index options traded on the AMEX, the exchange said.</p>
<p>It said Bickford joined the exchange in 1995 as vice president of capital markets.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
